ichigan Democrats said Vance came to brag about policies that raised costs.","date":"2026-10-27"},{"id":"obama-rallies-ohio-michigan","title":"Obama rallies Democrats in Cleveland and Detroit as Mike Rogers calls Abdul El-Sayed the most extreme candidate in the country","dek":"Obama campaigned for Sherrod Brown and Amy Acton in Ohio and for El-Sayed and Jocelyn Benson in Michigan. Trump voted early in Palm Beach and rallies in Port Huron, Michigan, on Sunday.","date":"2026-10-24"}],"media":[{"who":"Jason Colthorp","what":"Moderated the WDIV debate between Jocelyn Benson and John James.","when":"2026-10-15","lean":"nonpartisan"},{"who":"Kyle Kondik","what":"Sabato's Crystal Ball moved the Michigan governor race between Jocelyn Benson and John James from Leans Democratic to Likely Democratic.","when":"2026-10-22","lean":"nonpartisan"},{"who":"Steve Doocy","what":"Interviewed Republican governor nominee Rep. John James at a Romeo, Michigan diner on Fox & Friends, asking how he would bring jobs back to Michigan.","when":"2026-10-27","lean":"R"}],"donorSignal":null,"research":{"summary":"Democratic Secretary of State Jocelyn Benson led Republican Rep. John James 46 to 39 in an Oct. 1 Mitchell Research poll for the open governor's seat, per Hoodline. Benson has tried to tie James to Trump, the Iran war and Canada tariffs while James, who now says he would break with Trump on some issues, blames years of Democratic control in Lansing and attacks Benson's record running the Secretary of State office, per Michigan Public and WDIV.","issues":[{"issue":"Gas prices and tariffs","why":"Benson backs suspending the state gas tax and a Michigan deal with Canada to avoid tariffs, while James says the state has no role in trade deals.","src":"https://www.michiganpublic.org/politics-government/2026-10-07/james-distances-himself-from-trump-as-benson-tries-to-connect-them-in-gubernatorial-debate"},{"issue":"Income taxes","why":"James pledges deep income tax cuts starting in year one, while Benson promises a broad revenue review to allow tax breaks.","src":"https://www.clickondetroit.com/news/local/2026/10/16/benson-and-james-clash-over-health-care-trump-and-lansing-record-in-final-michigan-governor-debate/"},{"issue":"Data centers and electric bills","why":"Benson backs a statewide data center moratorium and tighter utility rules, while James says communities should decide and favors all of the above energy.","src":"https://www.michiganpublic.org/politics-government/2026-10-07/james-distances-himself-from-trump-as-benson-tries-to-connect-them-in-gubernatorial-debate"},{"issue":"Literacy and schools","why":"James cites Michigan's fourth grade reading ranking and is open to holding back struggling third graders, while Benson says teachers and parents should decide.","src":"https://www.michiganpublic.org/politics-government/2026-10-07/james-distances-himself-from-trump-as-benson-tries-to-connect-them-in-gubernatorial-debate"},{"issue":"Health care costs","why":"Benson pitches an affordability plan while James points to his price transparency bill in Congress.","src":"https://www.clickondetroit.com/news/local/2026/10/16/benson-and-james-clash-over-health-care-trump-and-lansing-record-in-final-michigan-governor-debate/"}],"storylines":[{"title":"Final debate on Trump and Lansing","date":"2026-10-15","what":"At the WDIV debate Benson said James does everything Trump asks, and James said Democrats in Lansing have not improved lives, after which Benson conceded they have not done enough on schools.","helps":"mixed","kind":"debate","src":"https://www.clickondetroit.com/news/local/2026/10/16/benson-and-james-clash-over-health-care-trump-and-lansing-record-in-final-michigan-governor-debate/"},{"title":"Poll shows Benson up seven","date":"2026-10-07","what":"A Mitchell Research poll of likely voters had Benson at 46 percent and James at 39, with Trump's Michigan approval at 27 percent.","helps":"D","kind":"local","src":"https://hoodline.com/2026/10/benson-opens-7-point-lead-over-james-in-michigan-governor-poll/"},{"title":"James breaks with Trump on Iran war","date":"2026-10-06","what":"In the Grand Rapids debate James called for ending the Iran war and a new trade approach, while Benson said for the first time she would suspend the gas tax.","helps":"mixed","kind":"debate","src":"https://www.michiganpublic.org/politics-government/2026-10-07/james-distances-himself-from-trump-as-benson-tries-to-connect-them-in-gubernatorial-debate"},{"title":"Data center profit charges","date":"2026-10-06","what":"Benson questioned James's data center stock holdings, and James pointed to Benson's husband's role at a company behind a Saline Township data center, which she says did not profit her family.","helps":"mixed","kind":"attack","src":"https://www.michiganpublic.org/politics-government/2026-10-07/james-distances-himself-from-trump-as-benson-tries-to-connect-them-in-gubernatorial-debate"},{"title":"James 9/11 themed ad","date":"2026-09-10","what":"A James video said Benson stands with a radical left that says America deserved 9/11, citing streamer Hasan Piker, and Benson said she would never campaign with anyone who says that.","helps":"mixed","kind":"ad","src":"https://www.fox2detroit.com/news/john-james-jocelyn-benson-hasan-piker-campaign-ad-september-11th"},{"title":"James hits Secretary of State record","date":"2026-09-09","what":"James cited misprinted driver's licenses and noncitizens found on voter rolls under Benson, and her campaign blamed a vendor and said errors were fixed.","helps":"R","kind":"attack","src":"https://www.michiganpublic.org/politics-government/2026-09-10/republicans-and-democrats-hurling-attacks-and-counter-attacks-in-michigan-governors-race"},{"title":"Democrats hit James on stock disclosures","date":"2026-09-09","what":"Michigan Democrats said James failed to disclose 145 stock trades on time, and James said he made no trades himself and is now compliant.","helps":"D","kind":"scandal","src":"https://www.michiganpublic.org/politics-government/2026-09-10/republicans-and-democrats-hurling-attacks-and-counter-attacks-in-michigan-governors-race"}],"events":[{"title":"Gas tax holiday","prompt":"Gas prices are up with the Iran war and voters want relief. Do you back suspending Michigan's gas tax?","issue":"econ","src":"https://www.michiganpublic.org/politics-government/2026-10-07/james-distances-himself-from-trump-as-benson-tries-to-connect-them-in-gubernatorial-debate","opts":[{"label":"Suspend and blame the war","say":"Suspend the gas tax and say Trump's war and tariffs drove prices up.","pos":-0.4,"trump":-0.9,"tone":"fiery"},{"label":"Temporary relief","say":"Back a short gas tax pause while protecting road funding.","pos":0,"trump":null,"tone":"calm"},{"label":"Cut income taxes","say":"Skip the gimmick and promise permanent income tax cuts in year one.","pos":0.8,"trump":0.3,"tone":"calm"}]},{"title":"Data center moratorium","prompt":"Data centers are coming to Michigan townships and electric bills are rising. Do you pause them?","issue":"econ","src":"https://www.michiganpublic.org/politics-government/2026-10-07/james-distances-himself-from-trump-as-benson-tries-to-connect-them-in-gubernatorial-debate","opts":[{"label":"Statewide moratorium","say":"Pause new data centers statewide and tighten utility regulation.","pos":-0.7,"trump":-0.4,"tone":"calm"},{"label":"Local control","say":"Let each community decide and require developers to pay for grid upgrades.","pos":0.2,"trump":null,"tone":"calm"},{"label":"Welcome investment","say":"Court data centers with an all of the above energy plan and lower taxes.","pos":0.7,"trump":0.5,"tone":"calm"}]},{"title":"Distance from Trump","prompt":"Trump's approval in Michigan is low and your rival keeps tying you to his war and tariffs. How close do you stay to the president?","issue":"other","src":"https://www.clickondetroit.com/news/local/2026/10/16/benson-and-james-clash-over-health-care-trump-and-lansing-record-in-final-michiga